@ECommerce.Api_HostAddress = https://localhost:7237

### OpenAPI document
GET {{ECommerce.Api_HostAddress}}/openapi/v1.json
Accept: application/json

###

### List brands (seeded)
GET {{ECommerce.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/brands
Accept: application/json

###

### List product types (seeded)
GET {{ECommerce.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/types
Accept: application/json

###

### List delivery methods (seeded)
GET {{ECommerce.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/delivery-methods
Accept: application/json

###

### Create delivery method (admin)
POST {{ECommerce.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/delivery-methods
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Overnight Delivery",
  "deliveryTime": "Next business day",
  "price": 45.00,
  "currencyCode": "USD"
}

###

### List products (paged)
GET {{ECommerce.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/products?page=1&pageSize=10
Accept: application/json

###

### Create product (replace brandId/typeId with values from /api/v1/brands and /api/v1/types)
POST {{ECommerce.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Classic Tee",
  "description": "A comfortable cotton t-shirt.",
  "pictureUrl": "https://example.com/images/classic-tee.png",
  "price": 19.99,
  "currencyCode": "USD",
  "brandId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000",
  "typeId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000"
}

###
